TITLE Ba-SO4 solution, heat 25 to 95 C in 5 steps; report specific conductance at step 4
SOLUTION 1
    units mg/L
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    Ba 2.0
    S(6) 15.0
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    25 95 in 5 steps
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -temperature true
    -step true
    -totals Ba S(6)
USER_PUNCH
    -headings SpecificConductance_uS_per_cm
    10 PUNCH SC
END
